<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on exchange rates.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on exchange rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc says it has issued one million New Year warrants, in five equal tranches, on three currency exchange rates.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  STRIKE	  ISS PRICE	  MAX PAYOUT</p>
<p> DEM/USD	   1.5250	  $2.34		$5.00</p>
<p> JPY/USD	   115.80	  $1.95		$5.00</p>
<p> DEM/USD	   1.4950	  $2.36		$5.00</p>
<p> JPY/USD	   112.15	  $2.15		$5.00</p>
<p> USD/GBP	   1.59	    $2.08		$5.00</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   31.DEC.96     PAYDATE	15.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  DEM/USD 1.5117, JPY/USD 114.34, USD/GBP 1.6171</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BTUT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
